{"key":"F28","report_id":"R0022","kind":"FIELD","label":"partition_and_assignment/exit_and_layer_partition","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"The collaborative workflow first selects an early-exit branch and then partitions the DNN layers preceding that exit point into segments distributed across multiple UAVs, with each layer assigned to a single UAV and no subsequent layers executed beyond the triggered exit branch.","page":2,"locator":"Section II. SYSTEM MODEL, item 2 (Model Partition)","excerpt":"After the exit point is selected, the model is partitioned into segments that can be processed across multiple UAVs. Each UAV will handle a portion of the model, executing the necessary layers before the exit point is reached.","quantitative":null,"reason":""}
